ragnaros source for Debian
==========================

The upstream tarball is GitHub's tarball of the v<version> tag, repacked as
<version>+ds without the files listed in Files-Excluded in debian/copyright:
upstream's own debian/ directory (this one replaces it), key icons rendered
from third-party application logos, and the Font Awesome font that only
tools/gen_assets.py reads. uscan does the repack:

    uscan --download-current-version

The test suite runs against the source tree (tests/conftest.py imports
ragnaros from there). debian/rules deselects the tests that require every
icon a bundled profile names to exist, since the repack removes some of them.

